r to kick a ball with.</li>\n<li>Use left and right when asking your child for things - can you pass me the glass on the right.</li>\n<li>Name your feet as you walk or climb the stairs or march - left foot, right foot.</li>\n<li>Use something to help them recognise one hand - a bracelet, painted fingernail or temporary tattoo.</li>\n<li>Play games like Simon Says with actions using left and right.</li>\n<li>Ask your child which way to turn when walking or driving a familiar route.</li>\n<li>Sing the Hokey Cokey song together.</li>\n</ul>\n<p></p>\n", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": {"heading": "", "checkList": [{"key": "4f76CB37OrdmyayRLHfQV", "checked": false, "listItem": ""}], "description": ""}, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}], "details": {"id": 305, "name": "Some more ways to practice left and right", "logCreatedAt": "2024-04-22T14:37:26.778036", "logUpdatedAt": "2024-04-22T14:46:45.845204", "logCreatedById": 108180408, "logUpdatedById": 108180408, "nameForContentDev": "Y1 Position Left and Right"}}, "order": 3, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "MODAL", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 305248572, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": 305, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": {"heading": "", "checkList": [{"key": "h-xARMNoPLpYphuQg-pB1", "checked": false, "listItem": ""}], "description": ""}, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 305248667, "text": null, "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 2, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "EDITOR", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 305248572, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": "<p>This game will help your child to learn their left and right.</p>\n<h2>What to do:</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Stand next to each other, not face to face.</li>\n<li>Make up a set of actions, or a dance, using left and right.</li>\n<li>Practice doing and saying the actions together.</li>\n</ul>\n<p></p>\n<h2><strong>For example:</strong></h2>\n<p>Step to the left.</p>\n<p>Wave your left hand.</p>\n<p>Step to the right.</p>\n<p>Tap your right foot.</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": {"heading": "", "checkList": [{"key": "YxUTHudLI_fn2ONzUEltR", "checked": false, "listItem": ""}], "description": ""}, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}]